{
  "_comment": [
    "The @UVRANGE growth-reference contract. tests/growth_php.php runs every case",
    "through php/GrowthReference.php and tests/growth_js.cjs through QRID_growth*",
    "in js/engine.js; both must return exactly what is written here. The tables",
    "are small synthetic ones in the page-copy shape (GrowthReference::pageCopy),",
    "chosen so most answers can be worked out by hand: with L 1, M 10 and S 0.1,",
    "z is (y/10 - 1)/0.1. The real WHO tables are pinned by tests/who_golden.json",
    "and the 5,000-point parity hash below."
